; Godot's default tooltip is dark; nothing here overrode it, so it fell
; back to that default while every Label's font_color is set dark for the
; parchment panels — dark text on a dark tooltip, the same collapse the
; Album's Secret tab had. Explicit colors rather than relying on Label's
; global color happening to work once the panel is parchment.
TooltipPanel/styles/panel = SubResource("StyleBoxFlat_tooltip")
TooltipLabel/colors/font_color = Color(0.25, 0.18, 0.1, 1)
TooltipLabel/font_sizes/font_size = 10
